\boxed{
I_{\rm full}-I_q=E[\operatorname{Cov}(S\mid Z)]\succeq0.
}
$$

Consequences:

- hard quantization cannot increase Fisher information;
- all retained-information criteria here depend on a quantizer only through $(W_b,m_b)$.

$$
\boxed{
I_q=I_{\rm full}
\iff
S=h(Z)\quad\text{a.s.}
